commit_plan.body_summary:
Adds sortable tables to documentation by integrating the Tablesort library. JavaScript initializes sorting on all unclassed tables within articles. CSS provides visual sort indicators (arrows) on column headers with hover and active state styling.

- tablesort-init.js: Initializes Tablesort on article tables via document subscription
- tablesort.css: Styles for sort indicators, hover states, and ascending/descending arrows"}

